sec.p:
Immediately following ultrasound, MRI was performed on a 3 T Siemens TIM-Trio scanner (Erlangen, Germany) with continuous physiological monitoring as previously published33,34. Following localization of the placenta and acquisition of anatomic, axial 2D multislice multiecho spoiled gradient echo images spanning the entire uterus were acquired at six in-phase echo times for T2* quantification, and \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
